t1_confection/OSTRAM_Inputs*.csv
t1_confection/OSTRAM_Outputs*.csv

# Per-scenario solver output (any chain of suffixes), regenerable
t1_confection/Executables/*/Pre_processed_*_output.csv

# storage_delay artifacts (regenerable when storage_delay_active: True).
# Covers both CamelCase ("StorageDelay") and snake_case ("storage_delay")
# variants used across patched datafiles, patched OSeMOSYS model, root
# datafile export, and OSTRAM_StorageDelay_* combined inputs/outputs.
*StorageDelay*
*storage_delay*
# Keep the source patcher tracked (gitignore does not affect already-tracked
# files, but this is defensive in case someone re-adds it).
!t1_confection/patch_storage_delay.py

